  "$forecastNote": "Forecast raster layers are expanded per model, per element and per level. id is modelId_element[_level]; band carries the display range and palette; model is the PMD data_type the tile is resolved against. The panel groups these by model and collapses an element that has several levels into one row with a level selector. One model is active at a time and drives the time slider. See scripts/ingest/ingest_pmd.py."
